        <mxCell id="m1y" value="&lt;b&gt;Skip GPS&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Station named by merchant alias, or by pairing with the driver's own log. If the two disagree → &lt;b&gt;Hand review&lt;/b&gt; (Resolution tab)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#EDE9FE;strokeColor=#7C3AED;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1">
