        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="o3" value="&lt;b&gt;PROVISIONAL&lt;/b&gt; (late log)&lt;br&gt;Missed the circle, but exactly one verified station within 1 km and GPS accurate to 50 m. Confirmed later by statement alias or admin Link. Driver names a different station → review" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FEF3C7;strokeColor=#D97706;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1">
